// Use this instead of section 1 if file 00 reports the documented Copilot Studio
// environment-level shape (type "GenAI", name "ExecuteTool") rather than the
// observed connector shape. gen_ai.tool.call.arguments carries the request
// payload and often contains the index name, which makes this variant strictly
// better than section 1 when it is available.
// Requires "Log conversation details" to be ON for the arguments to populate.
